# REQUIRES: verilator
# Gated page write-back (--page-write-gate, off-chip pages on page engines):
# each page's write-back bits through a register of their own, loaded the
# host cycle before the page's write (page 0 with what the write-back
# register loads at the state pass, the others from it) and held at zero by
# its synchronous reset otherwise, so a column's write data is the OR of its
# pages (about (p - 1) / 5 LUTs a page bit) instead of a p:1 select by the
# page index (about (p - 1) / 3). Against the target from zero state
# (tb_pages.sv: a model per virtual memory answering 1 to 60 host cycles on,
# `free` low at times): copies, overlapped zero-latency links, bubbles,
# nested sequencers with a short lead, staged evaluation, multicycle; two
# models' pages beside HBM link streams on shared engines (tb_linkhbm.sv).
# The report names the classes gated; the netlist has the gated registers and
# no page select.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t && cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/paged
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/c2 --static --page 4 --storage Leaf:pages=hbm --copies Leaf:2 --zero-latency-links --zero-latency-chains --page-hbm-column-bits 64 --page-engines auto --page-write-gate Leaf > %t/c2.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=C2 < %t/c2/schedule.txt
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SV < %t/c2/foldsim_sim.sv
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --top-module tb -I%t/c2 -DVM1 -Mdir %t/c2/obj %S/Inputs/tb_pages.sv top.sv %t/c2/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/c2/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/c2/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+1 +lo=1 +hi=30 +stall=30 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/c2/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+2 +lo=1 +hi=60 +full=20 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/c2/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+3 +lo=1 +hi=1 | FileCheck %s
# Two of the four pages gated (`--page-write-gate-pages Leaf:2`): pages 0 and 1 through their gated registers, pages 2
# and 3 through the page select (zero at pages 0 and 1), ORed in: the same tokens.
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/half --static --page 4 --storage Leaf:pages=hbm --copies Leaf:2 --zero-latency-links --zero-latency-chains --page-hbm-column-bits 64 --page-engines auto --page-write-gate --page-write-gate-pages Leaf:2 Leaf > %t/half.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=HALF < %t/half/foldsim_sim.mlir
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --top-module tb -I%t/half -DVM1 -Mdir %t/half/obj %S/Inputs/tb_pages.sv top.sv %t/half/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/half/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/half/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+1 +lo=1 +hi=30 +stall=30 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/half/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+2 +lo=1 +hi=60 +full=20 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: not foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/badg --static --page 4 --storage Leaf:pages=hbm --page-engines auto --page-write-gate --page-write-gate-pages Leaf Leaf 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=BADG
# HALF: _gate1 = seq.firreg
# HALF-NOT: _gate2 = seq.firreg
